  "description": "Variation of condition 2 (approved drawings) of planning permission&nbsp;2021/3208 dated 24/05/2022 for the \"Excavation of basement and formation of rear lightwell.\" The effect of the variation would be a reduction in the scale of the basement and omission of the rear lightwell.",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The development hereby permitted must be begun not later than the expiration of three years from the date of the original planning permission 2021/3208 beginning 24/05/2022.REASON: In order to comply with the provisions of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 as amended.",
    "The Development hereby permitted shall only be carried out and completed strictly in accordance with the following plans hereby approved and any subsequent approval of details:21-72.1 (rev B); 25-68.2; 25-68.3; 25-68.4; Sustainable Drainage Strategy (SuDS) Report; FCL/613/L01/AREASON: To ensure that the development hereby permitted is carried out in full accordance with the plans hereby approved.",
    "The details of flood resilience measures as approved under 2023/0046 shall be implemented prior to the occupation of the development and shall be retained thereafter.REASON: In the interests of reducing the opportunity for flooding on site and the surrounding area."
